# Canonical domain → no language redirects (SEO-safe)
# Primary: https://avatar-video-ai.com
# NOTE: keep locale URLs crawlable; DO NOT redirect by IP/Accept-Language.

# Force HTTPS + apex (no www)
http://avatar-video-ai.com/*            https://avatar-video-ai.com/:splat     301!
http://www.avatar-video-ai.com/*        https://avatar-video-ai.com/:splat     301!
https://www.avatar-video-ai.com/*       https://avatar-video-ai.com/:splat     301!

# Deduplicate index URLs (avoid /index.html variants being indexed)
/index.html                             /                                       301!
/blog/index.html                        /blog/                                  301!
/fr/index.html                          /fr/                                    301!
/fr/blog/index.html                     /fr/blog/                               301!
/es/index.html                          /es/                                    301!
/es/blog/index.html                     /es/blog/                               301!
/de/index.html                          /de/                                    301!
/de/blog/index.html                     /de/blog/                               301!

# Optional: when production is live, point preview domains to the canonical.
# Uncomment if desired (adjust your real preview host if needed).
